PROCESSING AND MACHINE LEARNING, CMNM 2024},
  da = {2026-01-12},
  doi = {10.1145/3677779.3677791},
  keywords = {Financial Sentiment Analysis; Large Language Models (LLMs); FinBERT;
Retrieval-Augmentation; Instruction-tuning},
  note = {International Conference on Modeling, Natural Language Processing and
Machine Learning (CMNM), Xian, PEOPLES R CHINA, MAY 17-19, 2024},
  pages = {76-80},
