(ACL) / Student Research Workshop (SRW), Bangkok, THAILAND, AUG 11-16,
2024},
  pages = {11854-11879},
  research-areas = {Computer Science},
  times-cited = {0},
  title = {Investigating the Impact of Model Instability on Explanations and
Uncertainty},
  type = {Proceedings Paper},
