Zhu, Yao; Zhang, Yunjian; Wang, Zizhe; Ji, Xiangyang, Tsinghua Univ, Beijing, Peoples R China.
Yan, Xiu, Meituan Grp, Beijing, Peoples R China.
Sun, Peng, Cent Univ Finance \& Econ, Beijing, Peoples R China.},
